signee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"### What happened?\n\nSeems like stores on amdgpu.fat_raw_buffer_cast for really large numbers (4x16384x16384xf32) will be correct for batch=[0,1] but on batch=[2,3] it is just filled with zeros. With the same write patterns but without fat_raw_buffer_cast, it seems to be working(more details on comparing them both is in the repro).\n\nAnother interesting point is we can make only 1 data off by setting validBytes to 2**31-1, but that seems to not be the right way.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\nBelow is a small reproducer with vector MLIR that does vector.store on constant data 2.0. no_buffer_store, as it's name suggest just does vector.store directly to binding.subspan, while yes_buffer_store.mlir, does vector.store on a subspan who has been caseted with amdgpu.fat_raw_buffer_cast S.T we can use buffer store instructions.\n\n```sh\n\n# Get MLIRs\nwget https://gist.githubusercontent.com/raikonenfnu/fcaadda91787f1fa1ce9240b56666ba2/raw/c9be99141e181cb0995f82c5f0d4b81a81de3e7b/no_buffer_store.mlir\n\nwget gist.githubusercontent.com/raikonenfnu/aebb228c93ca4680b9daf085c3ad7e1d/raw/598f257d4181c94f3f31b7d529218685b1aef59b/yes_buffer_store.mlir\n\n# Compile MLIRs\n/path/to/iree-compile no_buffer_store.mlir  --iree-hip-target=gfx950 --iree-hal-target-backends=rocm -o no_buffer_store.vmfb\n\n/path/to/iree-compile yes_buffer_store.mlir  --iree-hip-target=gfx950 --iree-hal-target-backends=rocm -o yes_buffer_store.vmfb\n\n# Run and test MLIRs\n\n/path/to/iree-run-module --module=no_buffer_store.vmfb --function=isolated_benchmark --input=4x16384x16384xf32=0 --output=@no_buffer_store_output.npy --device=hip\n\n/path/to/iree-run-module --module=yes_buffer_store.vmfb --function=isolated_benchmark --input=4x16384x16384xf32=0 --output=@yes_buffer_store_output.npy --device=hip\n\n# Observe that no_buffer_store_output.npy is fully filled with 2.0, and yes_buffer_store_output.npy has 0s for half of the tensors\n```\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2025-07-20T22:28:23Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68087699?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/raikonenfnu","id":68087699,"login":"raikonenfnu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDg3Njk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raikonenfnu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21425/comments","created_at":"2025-07-20T06:08:09Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21425/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/21425","id":3246033441,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21425/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDODGg